nfo"}}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "model rpl (raptorlake): Intel Raptor Lake / Alder Lake P-core (Golden Cove/Raptor Cove): Golden Cove costs, AVX-512 fused off; GFNI, VAES and VPCLMULQDQ on xmm/ymm\n  features: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma f16c pclmul aes adx movbe gfni vpclmulqdq vaes\n  dispatch 6 uops/cycle, ROB 512, scheduler 160, branch mispredict 17 cycles\n  ports: p0 p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 p6 p7 p8 p9 p10 p11\n  class        xmm/scalar: lat rtp uops ports ymm                      \n  add             1   0.2  1 p0156 p10   [U]\n  lea             2   0.5  1 p15       [E]\n  shl             1   0.5  1 p06       [U]\n  shlx            1   0.5  1 p06       [U]\n  shl cl          2     1  2 p06       [U]\n  imul            3     1  1 p1        [U]\n  mulx            4     1  2 p15       [U]\n  div r32        12     6  4 p0156     [U]\n  div r64        15    10  4 p0156     [U]\n  popcnt          3     1  1 p1        [U]\n  andn            1   0.5  1 p15       [U]\n  pext            3     1  1 p1        [U]\n  cmov            1   0.5  1 p06       [U]\n  setcc           1   0.5  1 p06       [U]\n  adc             1   0.5  1 p06       [U]\n  jcc             1   0.5  1 p06       [U]\n  load            5  0.33  1 p23 p11   [U]\n  store           1   0.5  1 p49       [U]\n  crc32           3     1  1 p1        [U]\n  lock add       20    20  9 p0156     [A]\n  call libm      18    12 20 p0156 p10   [E]\n  cvtsi2ss        5     1  2 p015      [U]\n  cvttss2si       6     1  2 p015      [U]\n  movd r,x        3     1  1 p0        [U]\n  movd x,r        3     1  1 p5        [U]\n  vpaddd          1  0.33  1 p015        1  0.33  1 p015      [U]\n  vpminsd         1   0.5  1 p01         1   0.5  1 p01       [U]\n  vpslld          1   0.5  1 p01         1   0.5  1 p01       [U]\n  vpsllw x        2     1  2 p015        3     1  2 p015      [U]\n  vpshufb         1   0.5  1 p15         1   0.5  1 p15       